# Generated data. `python run.py` reproduces all of it from a fixed seed, so committing
# 60MB+ of CSV would add weight without adding information. This is why the repo used to
# be 116MB with the same rows stored twice.
data/raw/
data/clean/
dbt/lemfi_analytics/seeds/*.csv

# dbt build artefact. `dbt build` recreates it from the models.
*.duckdb

# The BI fact table is derived from data/clean/ and is 6MB. `python bi/build_bi_model.py`
# recreates it. The small dimensions, the quality log, the layout PNG and the README are
# committed, because those are what someone reading the repo actually looks at.
bi/fact_transactions.csv
